{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio","s":"Here's the story of a lovely trivia question... that I am going to ask you."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Nommez les pays rencontrés si l'on trace la ligne droite la plus courte de Lisbonne à Helsinki."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Isn't the dad an architect? Oh, what is his name?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Oh, who is the oldest son? He's so handsome."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Are you spinning your wheels? The youngest son's given name is Robert."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"Remember \"Marcia, Marcia, Marcia?\" No? Okay, just type Marcia."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"Remember the middle sister? Sadly for her, nobody else did either."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8","s":"The housekeeper fell down a rabbit hole when she joined the Brady's. Not literally, that's just a hint about her name."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Yes, the housekeeper counts. And no, the pets do not."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
